a&_nc_ohc=HozJhOLLzX0Q7kNvwE7uV57&_nc_oc=Adrw3u5bUEwJ2KFpI8NoSTehHhi50ri1gcIzJMOTRJ7rddL9tsN9YyUiXo6LILcfYxg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU2JfhV4qea-k1-Kfmw8WzxoHlu0K6jvTrFUC6-NsH5yQ&oe=6B104824"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-1-alignment.png", "id": "1005930632535169", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1005930639201835_6987101909884018828_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JCIp4O6pFg4Q7kNvwGPp73Z&_nc_oc=AdppY1aZoWyDOd7AkRoNFrGvjX-ePK-iVckXWwxHrX4UAdCnkQegRSzvWvTLcTw2KH4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXNaM62TAUGleHBoyhdmtkuBxOhA9-wClv7hLl-rHkI_Q&oe=6B105BC6"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-4-moons.png", "id": "1648043520236033", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831393_1648043523569366_1043769257316157600_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vlwQcbd4R04Q7kNvwHN2gcK&_nc_oc=AdpEF_i8Drf5y0pz6ocxMAhGc0boLYq2sdSilTM9ryXnIvFB6FRI8cu46rcQjG-ko0Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVrHO6g5EJ3ux4pCFi00df-HbuhPjqQewPOBTqOA81xSw&oe=6B104492"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-spiral.png", "id": "1100777082812173", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1100777086145506_6071435689086224047_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ym6rDT_Y8sUQ7kNvwEp4v0Q&_nc_oc=Adqogfo2ysAynyrcHOu4Viy225b18lZez7uqOaXy_E-riNcR8QczK1UTthtW77tZhc4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU2bI7cBzncU5H6OLpf1G2vpTBEaFPdtgpdjSDgY5lMSg&oe=6B105397"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "universal-basic.png", "id": "1152553820442784", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673759338_1152553823776117_6844216478563381854_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iynY6GikTQwQ7kNvwE4Spv9&_nc_oc=Adpbe5YYqwziD99GYzLczzTdRy2xur91Scp_u-1r-Y5gWPxW_hUWVm_s5iShQl8QrCs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQU2mXam6q8NlBKIOXs-OvJYubot6wVf41eIr3WcbCe3gg&oe=6B10625C"}, "display_name": "Orrery", "keywords": ["Puzzle", "Space"], "long_description": "A solar system turns below you, drawn in pure white vector light. In your hand: a comet.\n\nThrow it, and the star pulls it in. Every planet tugs at it as it passes. Swing past a world and slingshot onward; thread a line through\nthree beacons with a single throw. Each of Orrery's 99 levels is a small puzzle of real gravity, and every one is proven solvable in\npar.\n\n  - 99 levels in nine chapters, each bringing a new idea: aligned beacons, swaying beacons, crowded moons, linked pairs, golden beacons\nthat only count after a chain, numbered sequences and more.\n- Real orbital physics: the star and every planet and moon pull on every comet, and planets move at their true orbital speeds.\n- Combos on the Fibonacci sequence. Chain slingshots and strikes in one flight and keep a streak going across throws to multiply your\nscore and earn comets back.\n- Rate yourself against par on every level, and chase three golden spirals on all 99.\n- Every size and distance in the game is built on the golden ratio, from the spacing of the orbits to the letters on the screen.\n- A sparse twelve-tone heartbeat score that\nquickens the longer you think.\n\nYou stand still and the system stays where it is, so it's comfortable to play seated or standing.", "short_description": " Throw comets through a living solar system. Bend them around planets, chain slingshots and strike every golden spiral in 99 hand-built puzzles of gravity."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://atonalfugue-ecfggyfue0efbwhm.westus-01.azurewebsites.net/orrery/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Atonal Fugue", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://atonalfugue-ecfggyfue0efbwhm